flowchart TD
    A[Mission, goal, constraints, artifact identities] --> V[Runtime schema and boundary validation]
    V --> O[Observe metadata or retained run evidence]
    O --> K[Orient: explicit knowledge, uncertainty, cost origin]
    K --> D[Decide: coordinate-list-v2 list schedule, at most 2048 nodes]
    D --> P[Fresh plan, planner stamp, and input hashes]
    P --> X[Act: registered operators in own Python worker]
    X --> E[Observed outputs, timings, reservations, failures]
    E --> G[Verify digest agreement and goal predicates]
    G --> M[Assemble result manifest and evidence chain]
    E --> R[Replan with new resource revision]
    R --> D
    M --> Q[Offline evidence replay]
    U[Package fixtures] --> I[Metadata-only bounded inventory]
    I --> O
    X -. worker, read-buffer, and model-budget reservations .-> B[Controller checks]
    B --> G
